  "title": "XRF-to-Optical Field-of-View Localization with Vision Language Models",
  "summary": "This study evaluates the use of vision language models (VLMs) for localizing X-ray fluorescence (XRF) field-of-view (FOV) regions in optical microscopy images, addressing challenges in correlating complementary measurements of the same specimen. It compares VLM-based localization with geometric controls and classical methods, demonstrating the effectiveness of the VLM approach in low-correspondence cases.",
